  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening local capacity: Connecting the provision of hydrological services with local economic development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCMSS will work with 11 communities in the Amanalco-Valle del Bravo region as well as with representatives of nongovernmental organizations and government to put into operation a structure to pay farmers for environmental services. The project will directly involve 635 individuals working on 220 hectares of agricultural land and forests.(ME-505)</narrative>
